{"id":"963b86b5dc15d7e3","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-clause.md","title":"Clause","display":"df-clause — Clause","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-clause","aliases":["57-df-clause"],"display":"df-clause — Clause","depends_on":["[[57-df-literal]]","[[57-df-pow-fin]]","[[57-df-satisfaction]]","[[57-df-assignment]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-clause"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-clause</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-clause — Clause"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1f6f3fb73df6e11c\" href=\"?note=1f6f3fb73df6e11c\" title=\"57-df-literal\">57-df-literal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3eb5cdea39272c18\" href=\"?note=3eb5cdea39272c18\" title=\"57-df-pow-fin\">57-df-pow-fin</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d5f7158a321b8947\" href=\"?note=d5f7158a321b8947\" title=\"57-df-assignment\">57-df-assignment</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Clause\">Clause</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为固定语言，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lit}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Lit}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline L\">\\(\\overline L\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(L)\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(L)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pol}(L)\">\\(\\operatorname{pol}(L)\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"1f6f3fb73df6e11c\" href=\"?note=1f6f3fb73df6e11c\" title=\"57-df-literal\">57-df-literal</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Lit}_S)\">\\(C\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Lit}_S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v:\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(v:\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\">\\(\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\)</span>。带 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 下标的满足为命题赋值满足，不带下标为结构满足。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Clause}_S\\coloneqq\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Lit}_S),\\qquad\\square\\coloneqq\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Clause}_S\\coloneqq\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Lit}_S),\\qquad\\square\\coloneqq\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v\\models_p C\\leftrightarrow\\exists L\\in C\\;(v(\\operatorname{atom}(L))=\\operatorname{pol}(L)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v\\models_p C\\leftrightarrow\\exists L\\in C\\;(v(\\operatorname{atom}(L))=\\operatorname{pol}(L)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models C\\leftrightarrow\\exists L\\in C\\;((\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models L),\\qquad\\mathfrak A\\models C\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;((\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models C\\leftrightarrow\\exists L\\in C\\;((\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models L),\\qquad\\mathfrak A\\models C\\leftrightarrow\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;((\\mathfrak A,\\beta)\\models C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>子句：文字的有穷集合（视为析取）</li>\n<li>空子句表示矛盾</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Clause","text":"Clause","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"1f6f3fb73df6e11c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-literal]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-pow-fin","status":"resolved","id":"3eb5cdea39272c18","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-pow-fin]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"03dc48eb29950767","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-assignment","status":"resolved","id":"d5f7158a321b8947","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-assignment]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"1f6f3fb73df6e11c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ 为固定语言，$\\mathrm{Lit}_S$、$\\overline L$、$\\operatorname{atom}(L)$、$\\operatorname{pol}(L)$ 取 [[57-df-literal]]。$C\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathrm{Lit}_S)$，$v:\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Struct}_S$，$\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)$。带 $p$ 下标的满足为命题赋值满足，不带下标为结构满足。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mat