$ 的文字原子都是闭的关系原子（无等号）。$N\\models\\square$ 表示不存在同时满足 $N$ 中所有子句的 $S$-结构。"},{"id":"ca4dd8b012648fba","anchor":"ref-20","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[57-df-Lomega1omega]]\n[[57-df-S-ar]]\n[[57-df-SequentCalculus]]\n[[57-df-W-e]]\n[[57-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[57-df-acf]]\n[[57-df-arith0]]\n[[57-df-arithmetic-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arithmetical-hierarchy]]\n[[57-df-arity]]\n[[57-df-assignment]]\n[[57-df-atomic-formula]]\n[[57-df-axiom-rule]]\n[[57-df-axiom-sequent]]\n[[57-df-back-and-forth]]\n[[57-df-beta-function]]\n[[57-df-boolean-algebra]]\n[[57-df-bound-variable]]\n[[57-df-cardinal]]\n[[57-df-clause]]\n[[57-df-clause-set]]\n[[57-df-closed-world-assumption]]\n[[57-df-closure-operator]]\n[[57-df-cnf]]\n[[57-df-compactness-property]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-conjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-consistency]]\n[[57-df-consistent]]\n[[57-df-constant]]\n[[57-df-contract-left]]\n[[57-df-contract-right]]\n[[57-df-creative]]\n[[57-df-cut-sequent]]\n[[57-df-decidable-theory]]\n[[57-df-definite-program]]\n[[57-df-derivable]]\n[[57-df-derivation]]\n[[57-df-disjunction-left]]\n[[57-df-disjunction-right]]\n[[57-df-dlo]]\n[[57-df-dnf]]\n[[57-df-domain]]\n[[57-df-dovf]]\n[[57-df-dovf-signature]]\n[[57-df-downward-LS-property]]\n[[57-df-dpll]]\n[[57-df-ef-game]]\n[[57-df-elementary-equivalence]]\n[[57-df-elementary-substructure]]\n[[57-df-emptyset]]\n[[57-df-endomorphism-algebra]]\n[[57-df-equality-left]]\n[[57-df-equality-right]]\n[[57-df-equiv-left]]\n[[57-df-equiv-right]]\n[[57-df-existential-left]]\n[[57-df-existential-right]]\n[[57-df-existential-variable]]\n[[57-df-exists-left]]\n[[57-df-exists-right]]\n[[57-df-explicit-definability]]\n[[57-df-family]]\n[[57-df-field]]\n[[57-df-filter]]\n[[57-df-fin-deriv-tree]]\n[[57-df-finite]]\n[[57-df-finite-model-property]]\n[[57-df-finite-subset]]\n[[57-df-first-order-language]]\n[[57-df-forall-left]]\n[[57-df-forall-right]]\n[[57-df-formula]]\n[[57-df-formula-algebra]]\n[[57-df-formula-substitution]]\n[[57-df-free-for]]\n[[57-